---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Business Process Automation & Custom Software Services | Static Pulse Sites"
  description="Explore website development, AI systems and automation, and custom internal software built for small and medium businesses."
>
  <main class="services-page">
    <section class="services-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="services-hero-grid">
          <div class="services-hero-copy">
            <h1>Business systems built around the way your company works</h1>

            <p>
              Static Pulse Sites helps small and medium businesses improve their
              public-facing websites, automate repetitive processes, and build
              focused internal software when existing tools are not enough.
            </p>

            <div class="services-button-row">
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
                Start Your Project
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="services-hero-image">
            <img
              src="/images/custom-coded-website-workspace.jpg"
              alt="Custom-coded website development workspace"
              width="1536"
              height="1024"
              loading="eager"
              fetchpriority="high"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="services-heading">
          <h2>Three connected ways to improve your business</h2>

          <p>
            Each service can stand alone or become part of a larger system. We
            recommend the simplest solution that addresses the problem.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="services-grid">
          <a
            class="service-option"
            href="/services/website-development"
            aria-label="Explore custom website development for small businesses"
          >
            <div>
              <h3>Website Development</h3>

              <p>
                Fast, secure websites that support your customer journey and
                connect with the tools behind your business.
              </p>
            </div>

            <span>Explore Website Development →</span>
          </a>

          <a
            class="service-option"
            href="/services/ai-systems-automation"
            aria-label="Explore AI automation services for small businesses"
          >
            <div>
              <h3>AI Systems &amp; Automation</h3>

              <p>
                Practical workflows that connect your existing platforms and
                reduce repetitive manual work.
              </p>
            </div>

            <span>Explore AI Systems &amp; Automation →</span>
          </a>

          <a
            class="service-option"
            href="/services/custom-internal-software"
            aria-label="Explore custom internal software development"
          >
            <div>
              <h3>Custom Internal Software</h3>

              <p>
                Focused internal tools designed around the way your team manages
                clients, information, projects, and operations.
              </p>
            </div>

            <span>Explore Custom Internal Software →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services-final-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="services-final-cta">
          <h2>Not sure which service fits the problem?</h2>

          <p>
            Tell us what is slowing your business down. You do not need to know
            which technology or service you need before contacting us.
          </p>

          <div class="services-button-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
              Start Your Project
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .services-page {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .services-hero {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 4vw, 4.5rem) 0;
  }

  .services-hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .services-hero-copy h1 {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .services-hero-copy > p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .services-button-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .services-hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(340px, 32vw, 460px);
    padding: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)
    );
  }

  .services-hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    border-radius: 17px;
  }

  .services-section {
    padding: clamp(2.75rem, 4vw, 4rem) 0;
  }

  .services-heading {
    max-width: 950px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(2.5rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .services-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .services-heading p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 1.15rem auto 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
  }

  .service-option {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 100%;
    padding: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)
    );
    transition:
      transform 180ms ease,
      border-color 180ms ease,
      background-color 180ms ease;
  }

  .service-option:hover,
  .service-option:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: rgba(24, 185, 215, 0.055);
  }

  .service-option:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid rgba(24, 185, 215, 0.35);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .service-option h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .service-option p {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .service-option span {
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .services-final-section {
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 3vw, 3.25rem) 0
      clamp(3rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }

  .services-final-cta {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top right,
        rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.12),
        transparent 38%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045),
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)
      );
  }

  .services-final-cta h2 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .services-final-cta > p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .services-final-cta .services-button-row {
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .services-hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .services-hero-copy {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .services-hero-copy h1,
    .services-hero-copy > p {
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .services-button-row {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .services-hero-image {
      height: 340px;
    }

    .services-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .services-hero {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
    }

    .services-hero-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .services-hero-copy {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .services-hero-copy h1 {
      max-width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 10vw, 3rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .services-hero-copy > p {
      max-width: 100%;
      margin: 1.25rem auto 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .services-button-row {
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    .services-button-row .btn {
      width: auto;
      min-width: 230px;
    }

    .services-hero-image {
      width: 100%;
      height: 260px;
      padding: 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 22px;
    }

    .services-hero-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .services-section {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
    }

    .services-heading {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .services-heading h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 8vw, 2.5rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
    }

    .services-heading p {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .service-option {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .service-option h3 {
      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 6vw, 1.75rem);
      line-height: 1.12;
    }

    .service-option p {
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .service-option span {
      padding-top: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .services-final-section {
      padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
    }

    .services-final-cta {
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 22px;
    }

    .services-final-cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 8vw, 2.5rem);
    }

    .services-final-cta > p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .services-final-cta .services-button-row .btn {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .service-option {
      transition: none;
    }

    .service-option:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>